  steps:[
    "Sit around the table <b>1, 2, 1, 2</b>. Your number is your team — four players minimum, at least two each side.",
    "On your turn, get your teammates — the others with your number — to guess <b>the word at the top of the card</b>.",
    "The <b>five words below it are banned</b>. So is the word itself, any part of it, and gestures.",
    "<b>The other team judges.</b> They see the same card: <b>Correct</b> when you get it, <b>Buzz</b> for a banned word (it asks them to confirm). Only the describer can pass.",
    "Every card holds <b>four words</b> — two on the front, two on the back. <b>Tap the card</b> to turn to the next one without scoring.",
    "When the sand runs out the next player is up. Go round the table an agreed number of times; <b>most points wins</b>."
  ],
